# Proxmox VE MCP

Go MCP server for Proxmox Virtual Environment.

Cursor uses `.cursor/rules/` (this file + org common). Copilot instructions under `.github/` remain for other tools.

## Conventions

- Prefer env / `.env.example` for Proxmox URL and API tokens
- Confirm destructive VM/CT actions; prefer dry-run / list tools first
- Do not commit live credentials or cluster secrets
